{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7cb9b096-39ba-59a3-b9e5-fd6296e0034f", "source_ordinal": 1337, "reading_ordinal": 2720, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "群氓", "published_at": "2024-09-05T05:37:11+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/21268373/answer/3616097925"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "说这种话的人，一般都是还没得上抑郁症的准病人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "为啥呢？", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "因为这是受抑郁症教育前才会有的思想症状。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 49}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "等到抑郁症一来，自己走到了床都起不来、门都出不去的地步，趴在窗前看着街上忙忙碌碌、能说会笑的“愚蠢的群众”，才会意识到“ta们至少能做到在这个残酷、黑暗、充满谎言和无常的世界上正常的生活，能起来上班，不但自己能活下去，还能养活子女父母”。", "char_start": 50, "char_end": 169}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "之前整天觉得自己聪明无比，俯视众生，可以领导世界革命，看谁都比自己愚蠢。到了这一步，才会承认其实自己连最平凡、最普通的群众每天都在做的事都做不到。", "char_start": 170, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "群众“愚蠢”？", "char_start": 244, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你知道在这个世界上有声有色的活着，甚至还背负着别人一起活着是一个多么艰难、多么复杂的事业吗？", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 298}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这不光是有一套劳动技能的问题，还有无数的心魔要降服，要对无数的人达成不低于及格水平的了解。", "char_start": 299, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "一群能在炮火连天的战场上背着战友穿越火线的老兵，轮得到你这个趴在壕沟里连头都抬不起来的军校生嘲笑“愚蠢”？", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 398}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "谁得出这种结论，只有一种可能，就是自己还不知道自己有多蠢。", "char_start": 399, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这不是叫你把群众当神仙崇拜，而是叫你基于基本的事实证据承认现实本来的明显结论。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 468}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "藐视群众，本质上是在藐视世界的复杂性。因为群众显然是战胜了——或至少适应了——这种复杂性的人。", "char_start": 469, "char_end": 516}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "群众根本不愚蠢，而且聪明得很，ta们真正的问题并不是智商或者理性欠缺，而是缺少情报、缺少组织协调、交易妥协的经验。", "char_start": 517, "char_end": 574}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "“情报”其实组织才会真的拥有的系统资产，个人很难获得称得上情报的东西，所以往往被战争迷雾困住，使得智慧和理性难以发挥拥有的水平，这也往往是一些经过新教育的小孩子喜欢嘲笑群众的原因——因为这些脱产的小孩子不但有大把时间，而且还沉浸在整个社会通过教育系统慷慨馈赠的情报中。但实际上这些学生们在真正的智慧和理性方面堪称毫无积累，那远比“基于高度提纯的数学逻辑进行纸面运算”所需要的程度高得多，就像在脸盆里测试模型船和驾船横穿大西洋的差距一样。", "char_start": 575, "char_end": 793}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "群众面对的另一个困难，是一群人要在一起协调出一个一致的行动，展现出组织的力量，需要完成大量专业的谈判工作，去达成大量的利益交换和信用建设工作。ta们往往无法在紧急的事态下拿出这个资源来完成这个前置工作，因而很难呈现出有效的集体行动。", "char_start": 794, "char_end": 910}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这根本不是因为“群众愚蠢”，而是组织协调并不是“群众专业”的必修课，也不是ta们在毕业前就必须完成的作业。", "char_start": 911, "char_end": 964}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "其实你把任何一个群众放到领导位置上，给ta足够的情报和资源，要求ta作出合理的判断，ta往往能做出出乎你意料的富有远见和格局的决策。", "char_start": 965, "char_end": 1031}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "但ta没有可能得到这份情报和资源，在没有这个基础的前提下呈现出的无效性怎么能称为“愚蠢”？", "char_start": 1032, "char_end": 1077}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "群众在做的是什么？x + y + z= 10, 请问x等于几？你来回答一个看看？", "char_start": 1078, "char_end": 1118}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "把做不出这种答案称为愚蠢，还意识不到在这个条件下靠猜的做出了一个经受住了事实考验的结果是一个多么强大的实力，这行为本身才叫愚蠢。", "char_start": 1119, "char_end": 1183}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "群众是缺乏作出正确判断的条件，而不是缺做出正确判断的素质。", "char_start": 1184, "char_end": 1213}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这个条件极难达成，不是谁自己觉得“明摆着”“显然”然后大声宣读几遍就能让人视为有效输入的。", "char_start": 1214, "char_end": 1259}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你其实不能基于你这类“说服”“沟通”的失败而断言是“群众愚蠢”，它更可能是你的努力没有达成让这事得以成功所需要的水平罢了。", "char_start": 1260, "char_end": 1321}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "没人说是你的错，因为这就是非常非常困难的事——你只想想光一个牛顿定律学校就翻来覆去给你讲了多久？给你做了多少实验、多少试卷？这么简单、这么确定的物理性规律，让你脱着产、安排了整整一群专业的人来拎着你的耳朵灌了三年，你照样在高考时答错题，你就指望着靠三十分钟甚至十分钟夹杂着不耐烦的呵斥的讲解让群众“接受真理”？没成功就断言问题出在“群众愚蠢”上？", "char_start": 1322, "char_end": 1495}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你想想这思维严谨性值不值得你自信？", "char_start": 1496, "char_end": 1513}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这么大的洞，你浑然不觉，坦然的、笃定的确信这么残破的逻辑的结论，就为它给了你快感，你这个模式岂能不抑郁？", "char_start": 1514, "char_end": 1566}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "“群众的眼睛是雪亮的”，意思是当你把足够的情报展现给群众看，群众久经生存考验所磨练出的智慧足以做出合理的——注意这不代表绝对正确——的判断。", "char_start": 1567, "char_end": 1637}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "那是要补上“让群众充分知情“这个条件的。", "char_start": 1638, "char_end": 1658}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "这个知情，不但是指简单的情况介绍，还有充分翔实的方案说明、利弊陈述。", "char_start": 1659, "char_end": 1693}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "群众雪亮的眼睛没有得出合理的判断，短板不在群众的眼睛不雪亮上，而在于山洞里光线微弱上。", "char_start": 1694, "char_end": 1737}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "这也是这话被说出来时的本意——它本来就是要驳斥基于“群众愚蠢论”而要将对群众隐瞒信息正当化的主张。", "char_start": 1738, "char_end": 1787}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "但不要以为这是在主张“不应该有任何国家机密”——基于对沟通组织的难度的敬畏和对事情紧急性的妥协，你必须基于事物现实属性的限制而保持必要的机密——例如你怎么知道听到的只有群众？群众之中一样可能混入敌人。", "char_start": 1788, "char_end": 1888}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "但这绝不是、也不允许是基于所谓的“群众愚蠢”。", "char_start": 1889, "char_end": 1912}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "这才是这句话要驳斥的东西。", "char_start": 1913, "char_end": 1926}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 34}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0396"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：「90% 的人都是愚蠢的，群众的眼睛并不雪亮」，如何看待这种说法？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034"], "summary": "围绕“群氓”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“说这种话的人，一般都是还没得上抑郁症的准病人。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "说这种话的人，一般都是还没得上抑郁症的准病人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "423bb80a-1424-508a-9b37-7715329708f2", "source_ordinal": 1336, "reading_ordinal": 2721, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "礼貌的意义", "published_at": "2024-09-06T00:59:14+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/24528668/answer/3617094335"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "世界上对人最危险的动物是什么？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "是敌人。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 20}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "怎么知道某人是不是敌人？", "char_start": 21, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "没礼貌的人，就是敌人。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 45}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "不礼貌，就是在找死。", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "认为“必须对人礼貌”就是莫大的屈辱，", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "就是在逼自己死。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "教人“对人礼貌就是自甘下贱”或者“只要有本事就可以不用对人礼貌”，", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 118}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "就是在教人找死。", "char_start": 119, "char_end": 127}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "不礼貌，随时可能遭遇突然死亡，", "char_start": 129, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这不是什么文学性的比喻，", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "而是实实在在被人打死、砍死、撞死、坑死这种血淋淋的死法。", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "能延年益寿，这就是礼貌的意义。", "char_start": 188, "char_end": 203}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0396"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：礼貌有什么意义？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“礼貌的意义”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“世界上对人最危险的动物是什么？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "世界上对人最危险的动物是什么？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "43bd5bfe-7837-51af-a1a5-cc93c3ab8b57", "source_ordinal": 1335, "reading_ordinal": 2722, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "铁布衫", "published_at": "2024-09-07T03:31:27+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/625858757/answer/3618163480"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "我是一个刚进入社会的大学生，也是一个文静的女孩子，昨天在工作中查问题点，有个普工操作手法不正确，我好好跟他讲了，但他开口就骂我，骂的很脏，我没骂回去，后来找了他领导，他领导骂了他，我要他跟我道歉，他不肯，却还继续骂，后来他们领导叫他下班了，他亏了一天的钱。今天他来上班了，我跟我领导讲了，我领导就去找他们领导，要他跟我道歉，三个领导在场，他还在时不时爆粗口，还说昨天要是他手里有东西，今天进殡仪馆的人就是我！！！就是不肯道歉，我全程没骂过他。一是不知道如何骂，二是不想激化矛盾，毕竟领导来来给我解决问题了。后来他不肯道歉，领导叫我先去工作了，我也不知道后续怎么样。我后来越想越郁闷，我下次遇到这样的情", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 352, "sample_truncated": true}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我发现年轻人最大的一个困难，就是在不知道自己错在哪的前提下，无条件地假定自己肯定没错。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 396}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "例如这里的“我好好地跟他讲了”。", "char_start": 397, "char_end": 413}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个自我宣告的“我好好跟他讲了”，具体而言，到底是怎么“好好地”讲的呢？没提。", "char_start": 414, "char_end": 453}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为觉得没有必要提，觉得绝对正确，绝不可能存在任何争议，全世界任何人来，也绝不可能否定我这个讲是“好好地讲”，所以故事可以直接略过这一段，直接从“对方莫名其妙有病”开始讲起。", "char_start": 454, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "整个事件，我只想知道如何对付“一根筋、狂暴、没文化、不讲理”的人，而且只想知道如何“不带脏字地骂回去”。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 594}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "我不想知道、也不认为在“好好讲”这个部分有可能的任何需要改进的地方。", "char_start": 595, "char_end": 629}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我的“好好讲”学分已经修满了，我现在只需要修“好好讲”无效后的其它的学分。", "char_start": 630, "char_end": 667}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "我现在实实在在地告诉你，这是一条不归路。", "char_start": 668, "char_end": 688}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "“好好讲”是威力无穷的工具，有无穷尽的深度可以挖掘，而且是解决你一切的人际危机最有力、最首要、最必要的工具。", "char_start": 689, "char_end": 743}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "在思考“如何处理一个棘手的人际关系问题”的时候，如果你的精力不是大部分放在“好好讲”的部分，而是放在“好好讲”之外的部分，你的资源分配就一定是错的。如果你只能选一个方向投入智力资源，你最好毫不犹豫地投入到“如何改进表达方式”上，而不是“在现有表达方式维持不变的前提下，如何战胜对方的攻击 / 如何抵抗对方的伤害 / 如何修复伤害造成的后果”。", "char_start": 744, "char_end": 915}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "为什么？", "char_start": 916, "char_end": 920}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "打个比方，你就明白了。", "char_start": 921, "char_end": 932}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这个案例里的当事人的思路是这样——交通法规定了冲红灯撞人是全责，所以我“看到绿灯过马路什么错都没有”，既然“什么错都没有”，我这一条就完全不要再做改进了，我只想请各位大师教我一身横练的铁布衫功夫，这样下次不但可以不被肇事司机撞伤，还能当场发功把卡车怼个跟头，把该司机绳之以法。", "char_start": 933, "char_end": 1071}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我已经“好好地说”了，我凭啥还要“更好好地说”？那不是‘向恶势力低头’吗？”", "char_start": 1072, "char_end": 1110}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "“我已经已经完全合法地过马路了，我凭啥还要在绿灯亮起、路权已经完全归我的时候左顾右盼，防止有不遵守交通规则的车撞我？那不是向坏司机让步吗？”", "char_start": 1111, "char_end": 1181}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "看到这里面的问题了吗？", "char_start": 1182, "char_end": 1193}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你到底是该练“就算绿灯过马路还是要眼观六路”这种“多余的、不公平的、额外的”技能，还是要练铁布衫和索赔？", "char_start": 1194, "char_end": 1246}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "你还觉得你的合理性不可质疑，还觉得上面的批评“不公平”吗？", "char_start": 1247, "char_end": 1276}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你还觉得“只需要按照明确的规定做了就没有必要再做改进”了吗？", "char_start": 1277, "char_end": 1307}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你现在看得到你现在自信无懈可击的“明明好好讲了”和真正的“好好讲了”之间的差距了吗？", "char_start": 1308, "char_end": 1350}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "将来决定你的生死的，是你能不能磨平这个差距，绝不是“无敌铁布衫”和“确保对方牢底坐穿”。", "char_start": 1351, "char_end": 1395}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你完全搞错了努力方向。", "char_start": 1396, "char_end": 1407}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "而且这种错法暗示着你并没有意识到你离真正能在社会中有效地生存还缺多少功课。", "char_start": 1408, "char_end": 1445}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "意识得到这个功课，你以后就不会轻易地讲“我还不够礼貌吗”“我还不够善解人意吗”“我还不够委婉吗”“我态度还不够好吗”“我还不算好好讲吗”这样的话。", "char_start": 1446, "char_end": 1519}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "毫无疑问，这方面你永远摸不到尽头。但你不要以为这对你是坏事——正是因为这门功夫摸不到尽头，现在你所受到的沉重打击就仍有进一步努力去降低发生概率的空间，你就不用急着绝望。", "char_start": 1520, "char_end": 1604}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你现在是想走另一条路，即在“好好说”方面现在就封顶，转头去练铁布衫，练激化矛盾后的攻防战、治疗手段。指望靠绝对强大的攻防能力、治疗能力去免除进一步研究“好好说”这种“屈辱、神秘、必须向老人们低头”的“恶心功夫”的必要性。", "char_start": 1605, "char_end": 1715}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "但是你很快就会发现，在“好好说”的技能仅停留在“完全合规”这么低劣的水平的前提下，你会触发的出乎你意料的狂暴冲击的威力远远超过任何铁布衫所能抵挡的极限。", "char_start": 1716, "char_end": 1792}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "多少人抑郁到自杀，就是因为发现“铁布衫”根本不堪一击，而又在大脑里死死的守着那个“我明明好好讲了”的钢印，觉得自己根本没有“更加好好讲”的空间——或者说，要坚持“在这方面努力就是对恶势力低头”。", "char_start": 1793, "char_end": 1890}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "ta要拿死亡来谴责这个“逼迫我向恶势力低头”的邪恶世界。", "char_start": 1891, "char_end": 1919}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "“非要逼我在绿灯过马路前还要左右看，我宁可抛弃这个不公道的世界”——这听起来荒唐得不真实，但却浸透了年轻人的鲜血。", "char_start": 1920, "char_end": 1977}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "唉。", "char_start": 1978, "char_end": 1980}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "记住，只有“好好讲”无限的深奥性可以让你寄托永不磨灭的“我可以改善未来风险”的希望，可以维系无限的继续面对无常世界的勇气。", "char_start": 1982, "char_end": 2043}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "不是所谓“刀枪不入”的铁布衫。", "char_start": 2044, "char_end": 2059}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 1, "paragraph": 34}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0396"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：遇到一根筋、狂暴、没文化不讲理的人如何有文化不带脏字骂回去？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034"], "summary": "围绕“铁布衫”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“我是一个刚进入社会的大学生，也是一个文静的女孩子，昨天在工作中查问题点，有个普工操作手法不正确，我好好跟他讲了，但他开口就骂我，骂的很脏，我没骂回去，后来找了他领导，他领导骂了他，我要他跟我道歉，他不肯，却还继续骂，后来他们领导叫他下班了，他亏了一天的钱。今天他来上班了，我跟我领导讲了，我领导就去找他们领导，要他跟我道歉，三个领导在场，他还在时不时爆粗口，还”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "我是一个刚进入社会的大学生，也是一个文静的女孩子，昨天在工作中查问题点，有个普工操作手法不正确，我好好跟他讲了，但他开口就骂我，骂的很脏，我没骂回去，后来找了他领导，他领导骂了他，我要他跟我道歉，他不肯，却还继续骂，后来他们领导叫他下班了，他亏了一天的钱。今天他来上班了，我跟我领导讲了，我领导就去找他们领导，要他跟我道歉，三个领导在场，他还在时不时爆粗口，还", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 352, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "d10a0e4c-4d47-517a-9f0b-8ab8fcc3902c", "source_ordinal": 1334, "reading_ordinal": 2723, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "一招制敌", "published_at": "2024-09-07T06:33:36+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/0e45a7166ca011ef99c652540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "怎么防止冻伤？ ——注意保暖，提前关注天气变化迹象，夜间一定要寻找避风处休息，并且睡觉要盖被子，最好点燃篝火……", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "怎么防止摔伤？——注意跌落高度，不要在走路时看书看手机，如无必要不要在陌生地方奔跑……", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "怎么防止电击伤？ ——永远不要假定电路正在断电状态。接触电气线路必须佩戴绝缘防护装备。远离断裂垂在地面的电线……", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "怎么防止受伤？——小心一点。", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 172}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "看出这串例子要说明什么问题了吗？", "char_start": 173, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你在把“情绪和内心杂乱声音”当作一个总问题，要问它的总答案，你就只可能得到“多多思考”“想开一点”这样的答复。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "就像你要问“怎么防止受伤”，只能得到“小心一点”这样的答案一样。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 278}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你在极端地轻视一个你在它面前毫无还手之力的敌人。", "char_start": 279, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你要改善你的问题，首先就要从断绝这种“我只需要一个简单的办法就能解决它”的态度。", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 344}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你要学会一个一个的问这个杂念怎么解决，那个杂念怎么解决，这个情绪怎么办，那个情绪怎么办。", "char_start": 345, "char_end": 389}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这是对这个强大的、一再把你按在地上痛殴的敌人的基本尊重，也是对那个一再被按在地上痛殴的你自己的尊重。", "char_start": 390, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你不是败在一个一根手指就能消灭的小喽啰手里，你是败在一个光是要认清它的全部威力、找到可以对付它的主要招式就要花上几年点滴之功的敌人手里。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 509}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你是败在一个必须录下所有动作，开无数的会议，遍寻高手参详，才能一点一点地制定对策的敌人手里。", "char_start": 510, "char_end": 556}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "类似“怎么搞好学习”“怎么搞好人际关系”“怎么防止被骗”这类“巨型问题”，之所以你毫无进展，就是因为你在抱着这种幻想。", "char_start": 557, "char_end": 616}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "即使你已经一战一战地被鲸吞蚕食到了几无容身之地，你还是不想在山地、在平原、在沼泽、在峡谷步步为营、一战一战地赢，你还是在问群臣怎么才能一招制敌，一战而胜。", "char_start": 617, "char_end": 694}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这种幻想不除，你连真正可能指向有效性的问题也提不出来，永远会停在“小心一点”这样的阶段。", "char_start": 695, "char_end": 739}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "十几年了，你已经停了十几年了，你还想“小心一点”几年？", "char_start": 740, "char_end": 767}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "看清楚“如何防止冻伤”和“如何防止受伤”的答案的差别。", "char_start": 768, "char_end": 795}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "想想清楚你到底要什么，想想你以后应该怎么做。", "char_start": 796, "char_end": 818}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0396"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么屏蔽掉情绪和内心杂乱声音的影响，专注于眼前?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“一招制敌”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“怎么防止冻伤？ ——注意保暖，提前关注天气变化迹象，夜间一定要寻找避风处休息，并且睡觉要盖被子，最好点燃篝火……”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "怎么防止冻伤？ ——注意保暖，提前关注天气变化迹象，夜间一定要寻找避风处休息，并且睡觉要盖被子，最好点燃篝火……", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 56, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "262b530b-6c2f-5920-b8b1-219ed8460007", "source_ordinal": 1333, "reading_ordinal": 2724, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "小狐狸", "published_at": "2024-09-08T02:26:10+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/a83ef6466d4611ef9f6e52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "满足两个条件，就可以开始自己做决定：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）体会到了金钱的快感。这不是客气，而是自己辛辛苦苦攒零花钱买了游戏机、买了手办、买了冰激凌、请小朋友客，这种实实在在的物欲的——当然还是合法的、健康的——快乐。", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "要充分的认识到钱是好东西，是标准化的自由。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 122}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "2）体会到了钱是怎么赚的。", "char_start": 123, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这不是“你帮爸爸拿一下拖鞋，爸爸给你100块”这种大放水式的赚法。而是我打开外卖软件给你看——荷包蛋三块钱一个，小馄饨16块一碗，瑞幸咖啡12块一杯。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 212}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我向你下单，原价，你向我供货，货要我闭上眼睛无法分辨，你用家里的灶、冰箱、气、煎锅都要付费，自己去进鸡蛋、馄饨，成本自己担。", "char_start": 213, "char_end": 275}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "我不会给你任何特殊的优待，做得不行自己去研究哪里不行，我只给你一条优待——质量一样，肯定优先买你的。", "char_start": 276, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "钟点工多少钱一小时，每周ta打扫一次，你打扫一次，你们的质量要求一样，报酬也一样。", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 368}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "没有花巧，自己赚。", "char_start": 369, "char_end": 378}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "我帮你开户，你可以开始投基金、投股票。我给你加杠杆融资，你要付我利息。", "char_start": 379, "char_end": 414}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "合约自己看，收益自己算，亏光了打工还。", "char_start": 415, "char_end": 434}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "到这一步，你可以开始自己做决定——拿你自己的钱来为你的错误买单就行。", "char_start": 435, "char_end": 469}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "你可以做你买得起单的决定。", "char_start": 470, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你买不起单的、需要我买单的，你出一份，你有建议权。你不出，你就自觉的闭嘴，感谢我为你承担。", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 529}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "在数学水平上能应付上述一切的运算、在语文水平上能阅读相关的契约和法律条文，在伦理水平上能理解争议判定、责任认定和执行的相关约定，在具体经验上已经有了“钱有多美妙”“钱是怎么增加的”“钱是怎么减少的”“现金流有多难维持”这些经验，在行为上已经形成了“为一切估算成本、收益和风险”的习惯。", "char_start": 530, "char_end": 672}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "从这个时间点上，可以开始教“如何说服我给你更多的自由是合理而明智的决策”。", "char_start": 673, "char_end": 710}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你一切的自由，都要靠这样的“销售工作”引诱我购买到手。", "char_start": 711, "char_end": 738}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "向我解释一下，为什么允许你每周多玩两个小时游戏对我会有净收益？", "char_start": 739, "char_end": 770}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "注意，是我的收益，不是你的收益。批准你的这个请求对我，你的家长，比起拒绝你的请求多了什么收益？少了什么风险？", "char_start": 771, "char_end": 825}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "引诱我，说服我，给我画大饼，给我编恐怖故事，制造我的焦虑，虚构我的需求，都可以。", "char_start": 826, "char_end": 866}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "但是要像一个真正的生意人那样——不要干一些生意人没资格对客户干的事。", "char_start": 867, "char_end": 901}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "例如在地上打滚。", "char_start": 902, "char_end": 910}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "打个滚，营业执照停牌半年。你将失去一切融资杠杆、信贷额度，优先购买权和我给你的专营代理权，你会只剩基本零花钱那点现金流，你会深刻的体会到什么叫由奢入俭难。", "char_start": 911, "char_end": 988}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "自由从来就不是谁来给你的，而是你自己一点一滴销售，自己挣来的。", "char_start": 989, "char_end": 1020}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "有资格交易，能维持交易信用，你能有多少自由不取决于我，而是取决于你自己对你自己资源的综合运用。", "char_start": 1021, "char_end": 1068}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "这才是“让孩子做决定”的正道。", "char_start": 1069, "char_end": 1084}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "在这之前，你想要自由，那就加紧学习、加紧完成必要的科目，以便尽早的拿到交易员资格。", "char_start": 1085, "char_end": 1126}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "拿不到资格证，你的自由最多也就零花钱那一个月一百块，顶多也就够你决定买几根铅笔的。", "char_start": 1127, "char_end": 1168}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "相信所谓的“新自由主义”邪教，高唱“一切都让孩子自主”，本质上只是通过父母买单在供应没有成本的自由，最终只会养出那种到处勒令别人自担成本来向ta供应“天然权利”的凶恶的兔子。", "char_start": 1170, "char_end": 1257}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "上面这种小狐狸将来会拿这些兔子做围巾。", "char_start": 1258, "char_end": 1277}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 31}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0396"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子什么时候能自己的事情自己做决定呢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030"], "summary": "围绕“小狐狸”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“满足两个条件，就可以开始自己做决定：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "满足两个条件，就可以开始自己做决定：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b1950e66-57a2-5bda-aecf-76ac70f605eb", "source_ordinal": 1332, "reading_ordinal": 2725, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "完整规定", "published_at": "2024-09-08T07:12:43+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/545876916/answer/3619060017"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "很多人在思考伦理问题的时候喜欢将一些问题过度简化，这就是一个例子。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“用先生称呼女性”本身可能存在争议。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 52}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "在认为用先生称呼女性不妥的人面前用先生称呼女性不妥，没有争议。", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "在不这么认为的人面前这么做，没有不妥，这也没有争议。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "为什么这两者不能同时成立？一定要将“在谁的面前说”这个条件去掉，尝试得出一种“无论在什么条件下都一定适用的结论”？", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 169}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为这样会简洁、优美。", "char_start": 170, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "不带这个前缀，命题简短又优美，又具有更广谱的适用性，所以为了这个简洁优美、广泛适用，我要为这个有着无法解决的争议的问题强力的下一个结论，接着用新达成的共识去惩罚、甚至消灭与这个结论立场不同的人。", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "删繁就简，只需要消灭一部分不识时务的人，剩下的人就可以享受一个伦理法则简短优美得多的世界了。", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "何其美哉～", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 332}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "美你个大头鬼啊。", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 341}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这时候你要扩充脑容量，不要逼着世界反过来适应你有限的脑容量。", "char_start": 342, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "花钱多买两个硬盘好了，岂能为了省硬盘空间，硬去“简化系统”？", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 403}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "两种情况都不违背爱的原则，没有彼此不共戴天、你死我活的逻辑对立关系，完全可以划定前提条件，令其各安一隅，那就有必要用“各安一隅”法，让ta们可以各自安心的实践，让自然法去决定ta们具体的命运。", "char_start": 404, "char_end": 500}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你不要在自然法无法推论出不可持续性的前提下，自己替代自然法宣布其中一个非法。", "char_start": 501, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这样做就是你个人要与持有这个立场的人为敌，而不是自然法与ta们为敌了。", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 575}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "敌人是自然法，自己无论多么坚强、高傲，都只能一声不吭无条件认栽，老老实实自己反省改过。", "char_start": 576, "char_end": 619}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "敌人若是一个人，硬要超越自然法去自行宣布“你这个不合理”，那么这只有一个可行的应对，那就是对抗到底。", "char_start": 620, "char_end": 670}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "所以，这个问题就得这么解决——阴者自阴，阳者自阳，各自安好，不必强求一致。", "char_start": 671, "char_end": 708}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "不要在两个同样有可持续性的结论之中强行凭自己的个人偏好去淘汰一个，很容易挨打的。", "char_start": 709, "char_end": 749}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0396"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：用先生称呼杰出女性真的不妥吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019"], "summary": "围绕“完整规定”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“很多人在思考伦理问题的时候喜欢将一些问题过度简化，这就是一个例子。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "很多人在思考伦理问题的时候喜欢将一些问题过度简化，这就是一个例子。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "52223443-33d7-5ad7-8000-2d7a71c54302", "source_ordinal": 1331, "reading_ordinal": 2726, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "体育问题", "published_at": "2024-09-08T16:55:56+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/310636566/answer/3619488465"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "具体的来说，因为中国人没多少条件去踢足球。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "中国公民现场看过正式足球比赛的不知有没有千分之一。各个城市体育公园里，篮球场、羽毛球场、乒乓球馆……甚至网球场，比比皆是，但有几个有足球场，尤其是有全尺寸的足球场的？", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 105}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "足球对场地需求太大，对中国的城市基本上是负担不起的，即使是如北上广深这样的大城市，有正规足球场的场馆也屈指可数。这导致足球在中国极端缺少有效的实践，足球迷都不是踢足球的足球迷，只是看足球的足球迷，而且还是看国际比赛的足球迷。", "char_start": 106, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "在没有踢足球的看球人群的前提下，足球搞来搞去不过是上级命令下的公共性形式化表演。这种表演只需要行礼如仪、不出差错，本质上和戏台上演打戏没有区别，并不会有真正的技战术对抗，对对抗水平并没有真实的需求。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这个情况不见得不会改变，但是改变的基础不在足协，不在大城市，而在最近刚搞起来的“村超”。", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 363}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "其实地价已经决定了乡村才是足球的故乡。我们的县级市、城郊、乡村富裕起来，生活宽松起来，ta们参与到足球中来了，并且形成了比赛体系，足球才有正常的不但看、而且自己日常踢的观众群体，才有面向懂行的、热情的观众健康循环发展的基础。", "char_start": 364, "char_end": 476}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "坦率讲，我们现在在体育方面真正的课题其实应该是如何引导群众体育自下而上的发展完整健康的自然生态，即引导群众自行组织的竞技体育蓬勃发展。而不是如何自上而下的组织高竞技水平的专业体育去为国增光。", "char_start": 478, "char_end": 573}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "搞好各个门类的国内群众比赛体系，让这些体育项目在群众中热起来，提供权威可负担的兴奋剂检测、裁判、场馆、直播服务，为这些赛事争取国际交流资源、打通从这些赛事向奥运赛事输送人才的机制……远比派出顶尖精英小队在国际上再拿几个奖要重要得多。", "char_start": 574, "char_end": 690}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "我们对体育的定位应该全面的回归到体育的本质上来——即通过身体的竞技普遍启发民众的战斗意识、组织意识，形成对大量基本伦理的亲身的、立体的、永恒的身体记忆，这对改善我们的社会共识、道德建设、社会运行效率有其他手段——尤其是理论学习手段——不可替代的根本意义。", "char_start": 691, "char_end": 818}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "在现在这个技术发达的时代，人类搞体育，延长寿命、增强体质其实应该是次要目的，更首要的目的是以后果轻微得多的方式提前体验逼真而激烈的竞争与合作，得到直接“从实践到实践”的人生启发。", "char_start": 819, "char_end": 908}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "没有竞技场里的真胜负来将各种看似美丽的幻想存真归一，人类会淹没在由虚幻游戏、心理狂想所支撑的各种自洽而不堪现实一击的自创幻想中，而且在这些根本无法实践却头头是道的幻觉驱使下互相仇视、互相伤害。", "char_start": 909, "char_end": 1005}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "理论是虚幻的，反对仇恨和伤害却是真实的。这些未经哪怕运动场级别的真实检验的假、大、空的“思想”，现在却打着“言论自由”“思想自由”的旗号，靠着滥发心理奖励在年轻人甚至很大部分成年人之间泛滥，导致ta们严重的脱离现实，在不得不接触现实时遭遇人生观，价值观级别的崩溃。", "char_start": 1006, "char_end": 1138}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这本来可以靠“场上见真章”这种最真实而又后果最正面的方式在早得多的阶段、以小得多的代价抑制甚至消除。这才是体育对社会不可替代的作用。", "char_start": 1139, "char_end": 1205}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "然而这个作用却被严重的忽视甚至无视了。", "char_start": 1206, "char_end": 1225}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "回到这个正轨上来，体育才能为中华民族的复兴发挥它应有的关键作用。", "char_start": 1226, "char_end": 1258}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "最终，是这个作用被人民真真切切的看见，是自己的孩子因此而大大的免疫于抑郁威胁和各种空想、幻想的诱惑和挟持，让人民认识到你们的不可或缺，不是所谓的“金牌”和“国际排名”。", "char_start": 1259, "char_end": 1343}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "到了那个时候，中国的足球迷们首先不会再在乎国足的比分，而是在意国足在体育精神、组织伦理上的幼稚和低劣。而国足也不会再如此的荒腔走板。", "char_start": 1344, "char_end": 1410}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "在这个意义上，其实并没有多少人真的知道中国足球的问题——因为这根本不是一个足球技战术的问题、教练员指挥问题，", "char_start": 1411, "char_end": 1465}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "它可以被认为是“足球人才培养体系”问题——但不把“体育到底是干什么的”这个根本答案摆正，解决“足球人才培养体系”问题根本做不到。", "char_start": 1466, "char_end": 1530}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "当然解决不了。", "char_start": 1531, "char_end": 1538}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这实际上是一个规律——当你做了所有技术性努力，却发现某个痼疾长期没有改善，那说明你的问题埋藏在更深的动机层面、价值观层面。意味着你一开始就有性质判定、价值判断上的根本思想错误，导致你在用错误的战略指导战术实施。为错误思想服务的战略无论多么睿智，战术无论多么勤奋，都是枉然。", "char_start": 1539, "char_end": 1675}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "“我做了该做的一切，却一败涂地”，意味着你从根上有错。", "char_start": 1676, "char_end": 1703}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你在为错误的理由、错误的目标做这事。", "char_start": 1704, "char_end": 1722}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你以为追求一个目标就是朝着这个目标前进，这是错的。", "char_start": 1723, "char_end": 1748}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "人生最大的秘密就在于——一切功名利禄，得到它最快的办法是朝着能顺便获得它们的终极目标前进。", "char_start": 1749, "char_end": 1794}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你是在一艘会经过这些目标，但是却是航向比它们远得多、重要得多的航船上，在途中将这些目标一一捞起。", "char_start": 1795, "char_end": 1843}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "如果你直直的朝着它们驶去，它们不会出现在伸手可得的舷侧，而是会出现在能将你送进海底的船头。", "char_start": 1844, "char_end": 1889}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "这才是中国足球百年未能超生的根源。", "char_start": 1890, "char_end": 1907}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 29}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0396"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么整个中国都知道中国足球的问题，为什么还是没有办法解决？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028"], "summary": "围绕“体育问题”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“具体的来说，因为中国人没多少条件去踢足球。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "具体的来说，因为中国人没多少条件去踢足球。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 21, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
